        "sourceText": '# 21\uFF5C\u5916\u90E8\u6D4B\u8BC4\u7ED3\u679C\n## EXTERNAL RESULTS\n\n`CONDITIONAL`\n\n\u5982\u679C\u5BA2\u6237\u5BFC\u5165\uFF1A\n\n- MBTI\n- 16P\n- external Big Five\n- other admitted results\n\n### \u4E3B\u89C6\u89C9\nSource comparison\u3002\n\n\u4E0D\u5141\u8BB8\uFF1A\n\n```text id="external">\nMBTI says X\n\u2192 PHI OS treats X as fact\n```\n\n\u5FC5\u987B\u663E\u793A\uFF1A\n\n> imported external source\u3002\n\n---',
